        {
          "text": " Kosodi Daudi atemar atiar, “Mam luibusakinit adakar asaduku naka Edeke dimarai Ilebin: naarai kes abu EJAKAIT koseu adakanar asaduku naka Edeke, ka aijaanakin ŋes ikar kere.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
