        {
          "text": " Kotema kes atiar, “Iraas yesi ikapolok luka ikekia luka lukapapaa luka Ilebin: kitalaunos bonik, yes ka iinaeanakus, tetere ipedorete aitodokun asaduku naka EJAKAIT, Edeke loka Isirael, toma aibois naabu eoŋ ketemokinite ŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
