              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Sab 81:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Apotu Sebania ka Yosapat, ka Netanel, ka Amasai, ka Sekaria, ka Benaia, ka Elieser, isasedotin, kokusete arupepen koinaren kasaduku naka Edeke; Obed-edom ka Yekia kes ikagolok luka asaduku,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.24",
